# Google OAuth client ID (Web application) for the optional Drive progress
# sync. Public by design — the protection is the client's authorized
# JavaScript origins list in Google Cloud console, which must contain the
# exact origins the app is served from (http://localhost:5173 and
# http://localhost:4173 for dev/preview, plus the production origin).
# Setup steps: docs/google-drive-setup.md. Leave unset to hide the feature.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
